"Stream comments after the shell","description":"Send the shell first and the comments later in the same response, with out of order placement.","status":"In_progress","priority":"High","assignee":{"id":"dev","name":"Dev Patel"},"labels":["feature","server"],"created_at":"Nov 2"},{"id":"YUK-3","workspace":"Yuka","title":"Keyboard navigation in the issue list","description":"j and k move the selection, Enter opens the issue. Ignore keys while the filter has focus.","status":"Done","priority":"Medium","assignee":{"id":"sofia","name":"Sofia Rossi"},"labels":["feature"],"created_at":"Oct 30"},{"id":"YUK-4","workspace":"Yuka","title":"Status menu closes on outside click","description":"The menu stays open when the user clicks the page. Use a backdrop.","status":"Todo","priority":"Medium","assignee":{"id":"sofia","name":"Sofia Rossi"},"labels":["bug"],"created_at":"Nov 3"},{"id":"YUK-5","workspace":"Yuka","title":"Decode props of islands","description":"The client reads the JSON script of each island and decodes the props with the codec.","status":"Todo","priority":"High","assignee":{"id":"dev","name":"Dev Patel"},"labels":["feature","codec"],"created_at":"Nov 3"},{"id":"YUK-6","workspace":"Yuka","title":"Document the ppx attribute checks","description":"List the valid attributes and the error messages.","status":"Backlog","priority":"Low","assignee":null,"labels":["docs"],"created_at":"Oct 28"},{"id":"YUK-7","workspace":"Yuka","title":"Escape attribute values with quotes","description":"A quote in a title attribute broke the markup.","status":"Done","priority":"High","assignee":{"id":"tomas","name":"Tomas Novak"},"labels":["bug","server"],"created_at":"Oct 27"},{"id":"YUK-8","workspace":"Yuka","title":"Add a new issue dialog","description":"Press c to open a dialog with title and description.","status":"Todo","priority":"Medium","assignee":{"id":"maya","name":"Maya Chen"},"labels":["feature"],"created_at":"Nov 4"},{"id":"YUK-9","workspace":"Yuka","title":"Keyed list moves lose focus","description":"Moving an item in a keyed list recreates its DOM when the key stays.","status":"Backlog","priority":"High","assignee":null,"labels":["bug","client"],"created_at":"Nov 1"},{"id":"YUK-10","workspace":"Yuka","title":"Server action for status change","description":"POST the new status and answer with the updated issue.","status":"Todo","priority":"High","assignee":{"id":"dev","name":"Dev Patel"},"labels":["feature","server"],"created_at":"Nov 4"},{"id":"YUK-11","workspace":"Yuka","title":"Optimistic update rolls back on error","description":"Show the new status now and restore the old one when the action fails.","status":"Backlog","priority":"Medium","assignee":null,"labels":["feature"],"created_at":"Nov 4"},{"id":"YUK-12","workspace":"Yuka","title":"Dark theme contrast on labels","description":"Raise the contrast of label text on the dark background.","status":"Done","priority":"Low","assignee":{"id":"sofia","name":"Sofia Rossi"},"labels":["design"],"created_at":"Oct 25"},{"id":"YUK-13","workspace":"Yuka","title":"Sidebar collapses on small screens","description":"Hide the sidebar under 700px.","status":"Backlog","priority":"Low","assignee":null,"labels":["design"],"created_at":"Oct 24"},{"id":"YUK-14","workspace":"Yuka","title":"Effects must not run on the server","description":"Component bodies run with effects off during rendering.","status":"Done","priority":"Urgent","assignee":{"id":"tomas","name":"Tomas Novak"},"labels":["bug","server"],"created_at":"Oct 22"},{"id":"YUK-15","workspace":"Yuka","title":"Priority icons for each level","description":"Four bars, filled by level.","status":"Done","priority":"Low","assignee":{"id":"sofia","name":"Sofia Rossi"},"labels":["design"],"created_at":"Oct 21"},{"id":"YUK-16","workspace":"Yuka","title":"Assign issues from the page","description":"A menu on the properties panel to change the assignee.","status":"Backlog","priority":"Medium","assignee":null,"labels":["feature"],"created_at":"Nov 5"},{"id":"YUK-17","workspace":"Yuka","title":"Label filter in the list","description":"Filter by label next to the title filter.","status":"Backlog","priority":"Low","assignee":null,"labels":["feature"],"created_at":"Nov 5"},{"id":"YUK-18","workspace":"Yuka","title":"Cancel the board view","description":"Out of scope for v0.1.","status":"Canceled","priority":"No_priority","assignee":null,"labels":["design"],"created_at":"Oct 18"},{"id":"YUK-19","workspace":"Yuka","title":"Slow first byte on the issue page","description":"The page waits for every comment before it sends the first byte.","status":"In_progress","priority":"Medium","assignee":{"id":"tomas","name":"Tomas Novak"},"labels":["perf","server"],"created_at":"Nov 5"},{"id":"YUK-20","workspace":"Yuka","title":"Bundle size of the client entry","description":"Measure the emitted modules and remove what the page does not use.","status":"Todo","priority":"Medium","assignee":{"id":"dev","name":"Dev Patel"},"labels":["perf","client"],"created_at":"Nov 5"},{"id":"YUK-21","workspace":"Yuka","title":"Duplicate of YUK-9","description":"Closed as duplicate.","status":"Canceled","priority":"No_priority","assignee":null,"labels":["bug"],"created_at":"Oct 29"},{"id":"YUK-22","workspace":"Yuka","title":"Show relative dates","description":"Show 3 days ago and keep the full date in the title.","status":"Backlog","priority":"Low","assignee":null,"labels":["design"],"created_at":"Nov 6"},{"id":"YUK-23","workspace":"Yuka","title":"Empty state for the filter","description":"Show a message when no issue matches.","status":"Done","priority":"Low","assignee":{"id":"maya","name":"Maya Chen"},"labels":["design"],"created_at":"Oct 26"},{"id":"YUK-24","workspace":"Yuka","title":"Reconnect after server restart","description":"The client shows an error and retries the action.","status":"Backlog","priority":"Medium","assignee":null,"labels":["server"],"created_at":"Nov 6"},{"id":"YUK-25","workspace":"Yuka","title":"Write the release notes","description":"Summarize what v0.1 includes.","status":"Todo","priority":"No_priority","assignee":{"id":"maya","name":"Maya Chen"},"labels":["docs"],"created_at":"Nov 6"}]}</script><script type="application/json" data-yuka-answer="r:labels &quot;Yuka&quot;">{"ok":[{"label":"bug","open_":3},{"label":"client","open_":3},{"label":"codec","open_":1},{"label":"design","open_":2},{"label":"docs","open_":2},{"label":"feature","open_":7},{"label":"perf","open_":2},{"label":"server","open_":4}]}</script><script type="application/json" data-yuka-props="i5">{"workspace":"Yuka","title":"All issues","view":"All"}</script></yuka-outlet></main></div></div></body></html>
