<div class="issue-page"><header class="page-header"><a href="/" class="crumb">Issues</a><span class="muted">/</span><span>YUK-2</span></header><div class="issue-layout"><article class="issue-main"><h1 class="issue-title">Stream comments after the shell</h1><p class="issue-description">Send the shell first and the comments later in the same response, with out of order placement.</p><h2 class="section-title">Activity</h2><yuka-island data-name="Demo_shared.Comments" data-id="L0-i3" style="display:contents" data-start="idle"><div class="activity"><ul class="comments"><li class="comment"><span class="avatar" title="Sofia Rossi">SR</span><div class="comment-body"><div class="comment-meta"><b>Sofia Rossi</b><span class="muted">Nov 3</span></div><p>Should the loading state keep the height of the list?</p></div></li><li class="comment"><span class="avatar" title="Dev Patel">DP</span><div class="comment-body"><div class="comment-meta"><b>Dev Patel</b><span class="muted">Nov 3</span></div><p>Yes, a fixed height avoids a jump.</p></div></li></ul><div class="comment-box"><textarea class="comment-input" placeholder="Leave a comment" rows="3"></textarea><!--[--><!--]--><button class="button primary" disabled="">Comment</button></div></div></yuka-island><script type="application/json" data-yuka-props="L0-i3">{"issue_id":"YUK-2","me":{"id":"maya","name":"Maya Chen"},"comments":[{"id":"c4","author":{"id":"sofia","name":"Sofia Rossi"},"body":"Should the loading state keep the height of the list?","created_at":"Nov 3"},{"id":"c5","author":{"id":"dev","name":"Dev Patel"},"body":"Yes, a fixed height avoids a jump.","created_at":"Nov 3"}]}</script></article><aside class="properties"><link rel="stylesheet" href="/_yuka/css/related-a784a2c9.css" data-yuka-css><yuka-island data-name="Demo_shared.Issue_props" data-id="L0-i1" style="display:contents" data-start="interaction"><!--[--><div class="props"><div class="property"><span class="property-name">Status</span><span class="property-value">